        "TileImage": "$($repository 51a0b47f-9bca-4880-9a1b-0ef158a17c5d).Image",
        "Description": "After months of searching, the final operatives for the assassination ring have been found. They are the ones moving money, hiring agents, and marking innocent children and innocent people as elimination targets for money and power.\r\rOur client has asked for them to be eliminated, preferably without any other casualties. You will be granted a bonus for this, however it is optional.\r\rGood Luck 47. Lets End This.",
